window.products.push({"id":676002,"name":"Cotton Woven Kitchen Rug Runner 2x6 ft, Boho Small Bathroom Runner for Entryway Hallway Indoor Outdoor, Farmhouse Flatwoven Carpet Runner Washable Tri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rBXXhgLJL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Flatwoven Rug Runner, Thin, But Very Durable: High-quality woven runner rug for use in the kitchen or bathroom. Made of 45% cotton + 45% polyester + 10% viscose, water-absorbent, and washable. A perfect bohemian washable runner rug for kitchen sink, entryway, patio bathroom, hallway, porch, laundry room, living room, and bedroom, bring your home warmness and brightness A Perfect Gift For Home Decoration or Daily Use: Whether you buy the boho modern runner rug for holiday and New Year's Christmas decor or as a warm gift for friends and family, it's a great item you can't miss Farmhouse Kitchen Rug Runner: The moroccan patterned bathroom runner rug measures 2x6 feet. Please allow for slight variations in size due to handwoven rug runner and manual measurements. Package: The bathroom rug runners is PACK OF 1 Grey and Cream Color: The tribal boho runner rug is modern trellis pattern and farmhouse style. The accent gray geometric is braided from cotton thread and is elegant and beautiful, with good decorative effects. The bohemian runner rug background is cream and off-yellow, not bright white Cotton Bottom, Without Anti-Slip Pad: No anti-skid design on the backing, it is recommended to use a rug stick mat to avoid sliding. The cotton weave will shrink a bit, but it does not affect the use Moroccan Bathroom Carpet Runner, Small Size: Filled with boho style charm and modern Moroccan design. The farmhouse cotton runner rug designed morocco inspired which has geometrically patterned that seem simple but are extremely rich and complex in symbolism, and they convey deep visual beauty and emotions, woven pattern on the modern runner rug adds exquisite detail and craftsmanship Washable: The kitchen runner rug is easy to clean. Shake the throw rug and runner or use a vacuum cleaner when cleaning dust. If cleaning is required, we recommend hand washing, or machine washing in a laundry bag. Don't use the brush Decorate Your Room And Protect The Floor: Fine pure weaving, no fading, no pilling, give comfortable touch when people walk on them, protect your floors from moisture, stains, and scratches, and keeping home clean and dry Farmhouse Kitchen Rug 2x6: Super cute and chic pattern design, the boho kitchen sink rug will add tribal, shabby, and bohemian style to the room, bring your home warmness and brightness Widely Used: The kitchen carpet runner is a great choice to be placed indoor or outdoor in high-traffic areas, as hallway runner rug, kitchen runner rug, entry rug runner, bathroom runner, laundry room rug, bedroom runner, living room area rug, porch rug or puts it under the couch, chair, or bench","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rBXXhgLJL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COMAX","source_asin":"B08R6ZMKPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676002","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R6ZMKPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R6ZMKPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
