window.products.push({"id":676231,"name":"Disposable Ice Cube Bags,Ice Cube Mold Trays (100pcs/2400 Ice Cubes)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+ber3NF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Self-seal ice cube bags offers easy self-seal, without the need to tie the bag.   Highly durable material, suitable for contact with water  How to use  1) Fill the bag slowly & gently with water  2) Once full press middle of the filling neck firmly together  The neck of the bag hands or arrows squeezing, pinching, closing, and sealing the bag. Bag must be shown to be full of water.  3) Turn the bag upside down and it will seal automatically (show bag full of water and turned 180 degrees up side down with arrows)  4) Place in the freezer until frozen  5) Push the ice cubes out of the bag as required  Note:  These ice packs are self-sealing and disposable and cannot be reused.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+ber3NF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clarmonde","source_asin":"B09Y8HR63L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676231","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y8HR63L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y8HR63L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":676232,"name":"Under Sink Organizers And Storage Liftable Sink Shelf, ONADAK 2 Tier Sliding Under Bathroom Cabinet Organizer Drawer with 4 Hooks & 1 Hanging Cup Unde","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CVJuaKF4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique design】 Under sink organizers and storage are available in 14\", 12\", and 10\" adjustable heights to meet the needs of your bathroom and kitchen, among other places as well as to accommodate multiple bottle sizes. The bottom tray has a cut-out handle for easy pulling. The slide-out design at the bottom makes it easy for you to get items inside. The under-sink organizer maximizes the closet space under the sink, not only increasing storage space but making bottles and jars neater. 【Product Material】 Under Bathroom Sink Organizer And Storage measures 15 \"L x 7.2 \"W x 10/12/14 \"H (Height Adjustable). The 2-tier under cabinet organizer is mainly made of high-quality ABS plastic, and the four iron support tubes with protective layers are not easily damaged and not easily deformed when placing heavy items. It also comes with 4 hooks, 1 hanging tray, and 8 non-slip pads to give you more hanging space, making it a must-have item for anyone who likes to organize. 【Applicable Scene】 Under kitchen sink organizers and storage are available for multiple scenarios. For example, the kitchen, living room, bathroom, desk, balcony, makeup organizer rack, laundry room, office, bedroom, and garage tool baskets, also can be used as small plant stand. A hanging cup can be used to hold long items such as makeup brushes, combs, etc. Hanging hooks can be used to hang bath balls, and towels for easy mobility. The multi-functional design can give you a tidy home. 【Easy To Clean】 The 2-tier bathroom cabinet organizer has a simple design that you can quickly install without any tools. The bathroom organizer under sink simply wipes the surface with a damp cloth to clean the shelves, and the bottom tray can be removed to clean dead space at will and keep it dry and ventilated. The storage space under the bathroom sink has a hollow design for good drainage. 【After-sales Service】 ONADAK always focuses on product quality and service. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we are here and ready to help. ( 2 x Storage Baskets 4 x Support Tubes 4 x Hooks 1 x Hanging Cup 8 non-slip pads 1 x Assembly Manual )","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CVJuaKF4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Onadak","source_asin":"B0BHSNLYSJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHSNLYSJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHSNLYSJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
