window.products.push({"id":676308,"name":"Kitchen Science Moscow Mule Mugs, Stainless Steel Lined Copper Moscow Mule Cups Set of 6 (18oz) | Stainless Steel Mug w/New Thumb Rest | Tarnish-Resis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HrD6ImfgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✓ PREMIUM STAINLESS STEEL LINED MOSCOW MULE COPPER MUGS | PERFECT HOME BAR DISPLAY: Very durable and well-made to withstand everyday practical use. With their luster, our metal mugs make a great addition to your bar accessories and a standout centerpiece for your home bar display! ✓ NEW THUMB REST DESIGN | ERGONOMIC WELDED HANDLE (NO RIVET): Our stainless steel cup features a NEW thumb rest design that provides a comfortable solid grip! It has a good balanced weight to it. Each copper mug is unique with its own hammered pattern. And each goes through a standard 21-point quality assurance check before it gets shipped to you. ✓ FOOD SAFE & TARNISH-RESISTANT: US-based third party lab-tested and certified for food safety. We designed this mug set to be 100% stainless steel in the interior to be tarnish-resistant. And the copper exterior is protected with a proprietary food grade lacquer to help it withstand tarnish, rust or stain. Copper mugs are naturally prone to tarnishing over time. With its added coating and with proper care, it will keep its lustrous beauty worthy of a bar display! ✓ ARTISAN-HANDCRAFTED HAMMERED FINISH: Premium Moscow Mule cups, ideal copper kitchen accessories, beautifully handcrafted by our expert coppersmiths! Our 22-gauge thick Moscow Mule cocktail glasses will keep your drinks cold! It also features a smooth rounded rim. Serving your cocktail in copper mugs makes a great experience for a hit party! ✓ LIFETIME WARRANTY: We are an American family-owned small business and we take pride in our product! We have developed the industry's first ever 21-point quality checklist to ensure that you get the very best Moscow Mule cups which last long. To demonstrate our confidence, we offer a NO QUESTIONS ASKED 100% REFUND GUARANTEE. If you are not happy with our product for any reason, just let us know and we will give you a refund. Don't trust us? Just look at our near perfect reviews.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HrD6ImfgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Science","source_asin":"B0BL1NXKMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL1NXKMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL1NXKMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
