window.products.push({"id":676327,"name":"Cello H2O Unbreakable Bottle , 1 Litre, Set of 6,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ga-4SvpuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful and extraordinary Cello H2O bottle is manufactured by Japanese technology and is made of BPA free material. BPA free water bottle can be used directly to drink water or other liquids. It’s sleek and ergonomic design saves plenty of space in your refrigerator and in your bag as and when you carry it. Its design is sure to add a touch of sophistication to your bottle collection. You can not only use it to store water, but other liquids like soft-drinks, squashes etc. The bottles are not only tough in looks but it is also unbreakable and has a long life span.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ga-4SvpuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cello","source_asin":"B01AEMWVYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AEMWVYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AEMWVYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":676328,"name":"DA VINCI Personalized Custom Natural Bamboo Cutting Board for Wedding, Engagement , House Warming Gift. Your Text or Message Laser Engraved on the Boa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HxZtSD1CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great gift idea for the newlyweds, house warming, engagements and moms. Personalize this bamboo cutting board with your own text or name and wedding date as shown. We will laser engrave your names, last name & date on the board. Da Vinci natural bamboo cutting boards are made of eco-friendly renewable natural bamboo offering a durable and attractive cutting surface for all your kitchen applications. No dyes or stains are used in this cutting board so the natural bamboo color will not fade or wash out. Please note that this board is 3/4 inch thick, whereas most other bamboo cutting boards are only 3/8” thick. There are 2 methods of cutting bamboo for manufacturing a cutting board: Horizontal cut or vertical cut. Once cut, the pieces are then pressed together to make a solid board. The boards that are made of vertically cut bamboo are much stronger and more durable than horizontally cut boards. All boards that are only 3/8” thick are made with horizontally cut bamboo, hence, they are less durable. Horizontally cut bamboo can not be used to make thicker boards like our 3/4” thick board. The extra thick Da Vinci cutting boards are made with vertically cut bamboo making them considerably more durable. To care for bamboo cutting boards, do not soak them in water, do not use a dish washer. After every few uses, rub some vegetable oil or olive oil with a paper towel all over the board to make sure water does not get in to warp the board. We engrave one side of the product with the selected design and your personalized information, while the other side remains blank that can be used as a regular cutting board. Due to the nature of wood and the engraving process that is done by a laser beam, there will be natural color variations in the engraved design that may appear different from what is show in the image. Please double check your name, dates and other information provided as we can not accept any returns on customized boards, except if we made an error in production.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HxZtSD1CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DaVinci","source_asin":"B07GDQKKFC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GDQKKFC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GDQKKFC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
