window.products.push({"id":676514,"name":"HomeMate Side Sleeper Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain Relief - Bed Pillows for Sleeping 19\" x 29\" Set of 2 Adjustable Soft White Memory Foam Pillow ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x68nNQQiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Soft and Breathable Pillow】 - For a good sleep, have a soft and breathable pillow is important, our side sleeper pillow is the perfect choice for you. Our memory foam pillows are made of eco-friendly materials,non-toxic and hypoallergenic which are CertiPUR-US and OEKO-TEX certified，surrounded by breathable polyester microfiber. The outer cover is made of 280GSM premium 3D honeycomb shape fabric, keeping you cool, dry, and cozy all night. 【Unique Curved Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Relief】 - Do you tired of neck and shoulder pain? It is time for you to use our gel memory foam pillow. The unique U-shaped side sleeper pillow fits around your shoulders and neck perfectly to promotes neutral spine alignment to maintain good blood flow to the neck and head, this queen size pillows 2 pack also can relieves neck and shoulder pain and helps you fall into sleep quickly. 【Adjustable Height and Firmness】This side sleeper pillow for neck and shoulder pain is infused with gel memory foam filling, with which either the back sleeper, side sleeper or stomach sleeper can have a high quality sleep experience. You can add or remove the foam filling material to adjust the height and softness of the bed pillow to fit the curve of your shoulders and neck, to get a comfortable bed pillow. Our adjustable foam pillow can meet the specific needs of different customers. 【Excellent Gift & Easy Care】Our memory foam pillow is an excellent gift for those who suffer from head, neck and shoulder pain. If you are looking for a healthy gift for someone you care about, the Homemate side sleeper pillow will be the perfect choice for you and the perfect gift for you loved one. In addition, our pillows queen size set of 2 are easy to clean. You can just wash the outer cover with machine and do not need to wash the inner stuffing, which is more convenient to renew your pillow. 【Pleasant Shopping Experience】- We love our customers and always take best products and services as our priority. If for any reason you are not satisfied with our pillows, we will refund the full amount-no questions asked! We can answer your questions and are always happy to hear from you within 24 hours. So please feel free to contact us! 【NOTICE】Our pillows are CertiPUR-US certified, so we can guarantee the safety of the raw materials. It's normal if you get an odor on your pillow, because our pillows use brand new memory foam, and the odor will fade over time. If you want to speed up the process, simply remove the pillowcase and dry the rest of the pillow in the dryer on low speed for 1-2 hours (optional: dryer). If you don't have a dryer, remove the removable lid and let the foam sponge air out for 1 to 2 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x68nNQQiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeMate","source_asin":"B0C5MXP8JJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676514","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5MXP8JJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5MXP8JJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
