window.products.push({"id":676537,"name":"HuBDIC Steamer for Clothes, Portable Handheld Clothing Steamer with 250ML(8.81OZ) Big Capacity, Fabric Steamer 1500 Watts, Fast 25 Seconds Heat-up, Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FqWPvkVdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 POWERFUL CLOTHES STEAMER 】 Powered by 1500 W with steam flow 25g/min that soften the fabric and iron wrinkles. The effectively handheld garment steamer is ready-to-go water tank heats in 25 seconds. powerful power and powerful steam function, more than 80% of the steam can be thoroughly penetrated into the hard-to-reach fabric area to remove peculiar smell. Based on the function, it can prevent water leakage, safe and reliable, and easily restore your favorite clothing. 【 VERTICAL OR HORIZONTAL 2 IN 1 STEAMER 】 Clothes steamer upgraded 7-hole stainless steel nozzle design ensures it won't leak or spill.You can use it at any angle,whether you're steaming clothes placed horizontally or hanging vertically. Flat ironing and hanging ironing 2 in 1.Hanging ironing: efficient wrinkle removal,suitable for thin clothing, Horizontal ironing: exquisite plasticity,suitable for suit fabrics,first choice for commuters.Steam iron for clothes versatile and efficient. 【 PORTABLE AND IDEAL TRAVEL STEAMER 】 This clothing steamer, hand-held steamer, is light and easy to move and use, very suitable for travel and business. The water tank can hold up to 250ml, which can provide better full steam and extend the working time of up to 20 minutes, reducing the trouble of frequent water addition and saving you time. super light weight and compact, does not take much space in the luggage so it is easy to take on trips. The small size makes it very practical to use. 【 7 FT LONG POWER CORD & All-PURPOSE FABRIC SUPPORT 】 The 7ft long power cord is easy to use even over long distances. steam machine can be used on most fabrics, such as cotton, silk, linen, polyester, wool, velvet, and other common blends and weaves. This is not only great for your home, but also great for your travel. We’ve also included a 2-in-1 fabric and lint brush with each steam, to give you more versatility at home or on the go. 【 ONE STEP SELF-CLEANING 】 HuBDIC Handheld Steamer has an intelligent self-cleaning mode that uses a powerful pulse boost to clean the residual dirt in the pipe, extending the service life of the steamer. fill water into water tank to max, plug in the appliance, long press the power button 5s then the appliance begain self-cleaning, now the appliance will spray water out, which is normal. you will listen warning sound after self-clean finished. now you can unplug the appliance. 【 2-Year Warranty 】 HuBDIC Handheld Steamer comes with a 2-year worry-free warranty for every customer. Your satisfaction comes first, and we're always here to help. If you encounter any problems, please feel free to contact us, and we'll definitely solve them for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FqWPvkVdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HuBDIC","source_asin":"B0B2CF1NR9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2CF1NR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2CF1NR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
