window.products.push({"id":676562,"name":"Nude Pink Faux Leather Sheets: ZAIONE 7Pcs 8x12Inch Glitter PU Synthetic Leatherette for Bows Crafts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1V3fgXRqzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✿Design Concept: In response to the daily needs of handicraft enthusiasts,ZAIONE have launched new Nude Pink Faux Leather Sheets Bundle for you in 2023.In addition to the regular style,it also contains different styles leather sheets in similar color,can be used for variety designs.Enjoy the fun of DIY leather crafts. ★Product Characteristic: Nude Pink Synthetic Leather made from PU material,including fine glitter,solid color,chunky glitter,holographic metallic lychee leather sheets.Vivid color,no peculiar smell.The leather fabric is easy to cut with scissors and will not fray. ❤Satisfy Your Demands: Nude Pink Leather Sheets is ideal for a variety of craft projects.Perfect for earrings making,hair bows,key chains and so on.It can be cut into different length and patterns according to your actual needs.You can explore your creative side and express your individuality through personalized crafts and DIY projects.Enjoy our faux leather with your child,exercise her hands-on skills,also as gifts to relatives and friends. ✔Package: The collection includes 7pcs Nude Pink PU Leatherette.Size: 8x12inch A4.The thickness of each piece of leather is different,about 0.6-1mm.Due to differences styles in leather sheets,the back material will fabric,knit or canvas. ✉Outstanding Service: ZAIONE is a brand dedicated to meeting the needs of DIY enthusiasts.We offer a wide variety of high quality leather sheets materials,it easy for anyone to unleash their creativity,focusing on customer shopping experience and satisfaction.If you have any questions or concerns, please feel free to contact us and we will do our best to help you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1V3fgXRqzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZAIONE","source_asin":"B07QWP1M48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QWP1M48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QWP1M48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
