window.products.push({"id":676789,"name":"ZZWW Kitchen Knife Set, Professional 6 Piece Knife Set with Wooden Block Germany High Carbon Stainless Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OPm9pn4SL._AC_SL1470_.jpg","description":"The knives are characterized by high quality forged blades, which are made of German stainless steel. German steel knife (W-Nr. 1.4116). Material number 1.4116 of martensitic stainless steel. It contains 0.45 to 0.55% carbon, 14 to 15% chromium, 0.5 to 0.8% molybdenum and 0.1 to 0.2% vanadium. The purpose of the molybdenum alloy is to increase the resistance to pitting of the material. HOW TO CARE FOR YOUR KNIVES? 1. Before the first use, please clean the knives 2.When using, pay attention please. The cutting area of ​​the knives is very sharp! Do not test with fingertips and avoid direct contact to avoid damage. 3. Care when using and storing. After each use, please clean and store in a safe place. Store them out of the reach of children 4. To maintain the life of your knives, keep them dry and clean after each use, use non-abrasive cleaners. Use soft towels to clean. WILL THE STAINLESS STEEL KNIFE RUST? Usually the stainless steel we see, the \"stainless\" here is relative, not absolute, relative to carbon steel. Stainless steel does not rust easily, but it is not absolutely rust-free, but it is not easily corroded and rusted than carbon steel under the same conditions and environment. To prevent the rust of stainless steel knives, the main thing is not to damage the passivation film of the surface layer of stainless steel knives. After use, clean it as soon as possible and dry it. Try not to touch acid or alkali salts. THE KNIFE SET INCLUDES: * 8 \"Chef's knife * 8 \"bread knife * 8 \"carving knife * Utility knife 5 \" * 3.5 \"Paring knife * wood block","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OPm9pn4SL._AC_SL1470_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZZWW","source_asin":"B09QKRTK9N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676789","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QKRTK9N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QKRTK9N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
