window.products.push({"id":676865,"name":"Nile River Bazaar Egyptian Cotton Towels Mahalla Textile 2-Piece Set (1 Bath Towel 50X26 inches, 1 Hand Towel 26x15 inches) Lime Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912pMD6+-zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We went all the way to the Nile Delta to get you those special towels of 100% Egyptian cotton from the oldest native textile mill that was founded during the period of British colonialism! In the city of Mahalla, at the northern side of the Nile Valley, long staple cotton is cultivated, handpicked, and sent for spinning and knitting in Mahalla's famous mills established in the early 20th century. From the oldest, native-owned factory that was founded in 1927, we brought you this luxury bedspread that holds the original and official certificate of the \"Egyptian Cotton Association.\" These towels also carry all the historically famous and exquisite qualities of the Egyptian cotton: unmatched long staple cotton cultivated only in Egyptian fields; finest yarn; most resilient fabric in the world; durability; softness; unique colors and designs since British colonial times. The degree of the towel’s absorbency and quality is based on its GSM (gram per square meter). A towel’s GSM could be as low as 200 or high as 1000. Egyptian cotton is known for its high and luxurious degrees GSMs. We bring you the medium and best degrees of 500-750 GSM. This should ensure both high absorbency and quick drying. Machine washable and dryable. Wash with like colors. Natural material suitable for kids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912pMD6+-zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nile River Bazaar","source_asin":"B07G3V3DG5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G3V3DG5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G3V3DG5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
