window.products.push({"id":676910,"name":"EVERYTHRY Waterproof Vinyl Tablecloth Rectangle, Oil Proof Spill Proof Plastic Table Cloth, Wipe Clean PVC Table Cover for Outdoor Picnic Patio Campin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AQEJ7y-dS._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"🌟PREMIUM MATERIAL: EVERYTHRY rectangle tablecloth is made of premium eco-friendly PVC materials, odorless and kid-friendly, you can feel relieved to use. It is also ultra-durable, will protect your tables for years, you don’t need to change the tablecloth frequently. Adopting active dying technology, our heavy duty table cloths can resist discoloration and shrink, which will be as good as new. 🌟SIZE: This table cloth is available in various sizes: 55 X 78 inch (140 X 200 CM), 55×108 inch(140 X 270 CM) & 55×120 inch(140 X 300 CM). Please measure your table size before buying. The wide of a tablecloth= Table Wide + Drop length x 2; the length of a tablecloth= Table length + Drop length x 2. 🌟100% WATERPROOF & OIL PROOF & PROTECT TABLE: Crafted of 100% PVC, our wipeable tableclothes have excellent water, oil, heat, spill proof and stain resistance, all liquids will bead up its surface, provides the convenience when you cleaning your table. Plus, this heavy duty tablecloth easily protect your tables and furniture from scratches, dents, dirt and dust, sun rays, and kids' arts and crafts projects, which can extend the life of your table. 🌟EASY CARE: Compared with fabric table protector that need to wash once soiled, this PVC table cloth is easy to clean with the wipe of a damp napkin or cloth, which will save you a lot of time. NOTE: Please do NOT use a washer machine, iron, or bleach. 🌟MULTIPLE APPLICATION: Our simple wipe to clean table cover works in both indoor and outdoor settings. It is perfect for patio, camping, farmhouse, BBQ, and more. You can also use this seamless table covering to DIY and personalize your space, it can be trimmed into any size to match different furniture (tables, end tables, bookshelves…). It is also a great gift on Birthdays, Christmas, Thanksgiving, or Valentine's Day for a cherished someone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AQEJ7y-dS._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EVERYTHRY","source_asin":"B092DC9ZG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676910","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092DC9ZG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092DC9ZG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":676911,"name":"100% Natural Latex Pillow, Firm Latex Bed Pillow for Sleeping, Contour Pillow with Massage Peaks, Sleeping Pillow for Back, Side and Stomach Sleepers,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zfSLVyglL._AC_SL1066_.jpg","description":"100% Natural Thai Latex: Our raw material comes from the juice of the rubber tree grown in Thailand. It's a very expensive natural material, one rubber tree can only produce 30cc latex per day. The whole production is physical process. After use, the latex pillow is decomposed very quickly in nature, which is safe and does not pollute the environment. Due to the characteristics of natural latex, our natural latex pillow is cooling in Summer but warm and comfortable in Winter. Spa-Grade Massage Particles: Latex massage pillow with about 154 massage particles, patented massage peaks promote your blood circulation by massaging acupuncture points on the neck and facial muscles when sleeping. This pillow is soft but supportive, which makes your muslce relax and you can have a deeper sleep, you'll feel your neck no longer stiff the next morning. Also the pillow won’t flatten after many years' use. Honeycomb Structure Design: Dunlop technologies for latex neck pillow. More permeable than any other neck pillows by virtue of honeycomb air hole technology. Unique honeycomb pores to promote air circulation and maximize air permeability and hot dissipation. It prevents flattening and returns the memory pillow to its original form after each night's rest. High and Low Mode: 2-Zone contoured design, conforming to Ergonomics, makes it perfectly fit for your neck and shoulder and allow you sleep with multi-positions, smoother breathing and less snoring. The low side is ideal for back sleeper, while the high side is perfect for side sleepers who have a larger frame, or simply like a higher sleeping pillow. Washable & breathable Outer Cover: The outer cover is breathable for air circulation, giving you a cool and healthy sleeping environment. The dust-proof inner cover extends the life of the latex core more effectively. Wash the pillowcase before first use. You get a long-lasting sleeping comfort thanks to the two layer covers. Do not wash the memory Latex core, just put the core in ventilated place with no sun; avoid direct sunlight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zfSLVyglL._AC_SL1066_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Behandy","source_asin":"B0BJPXLTQ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-676911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJPXLTQ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJPXLTQ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
